        "产品归属以 backbone/catalog 为准，LLM 不 invent 新归属边"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "st-no-fa-fallback-skip",
      "scenario": "no_function_area_degrade",
      "doc_category": "StampTools",
      "section_path": "DOMBuilder > 影像数据的编译发布",
      "content_excerpt": "影像数据的编译发布\n包含编译与发布两个阶段。",
      "good": {
        "entities": [
          {"name": "影像数据的编译发布", "entity_type": "Procedure"}
        ],
        "relations": [
          {
            "source_name": "DOMBuilder",
            "relation_type": "has_procedure",
            "target_name": "影像数据的编译发布"
          }
        ]
      },
      "bad": [
        "无可用 FunctionArea 时可挂 Tool，但仍不要 invent FunctionArea 节点",
        "不要把「编译」「发布」拆成无证据的 ConfigItem"
      ]
